OL,3,GNEWSASchoolgirl told teacher 'Sir, I've
OL,4,Abeen stabbed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA schoolgirl who was stabbed by a
OL,7,Fmasked fellow pupil at school described
OL,8,Fhow she ran from her attacker and told
OL,9,Fa teacher, "Sir, I've been stabbed".
OL,11,FPolice were called to Thorpe St Andrew
OL,12,FSchool, near Norwich, on 11 March,
OL,13,Ffollowing reports that a 15-year-old
OL,14,Fgirl had been stabbed in the back.
OL,16,FThe defendant, who is now 16 and cannot
OL,17,Fbe named for legal reasons, has denied
OL,18,Fa charge of attempted murder, but has
OL,19,Fadmitted possessing a kitchen knife
OL,20,Fwithout lawful authority and wounding
OL,21,Fwith intent.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
